        	}
        }

    };
}


// NOTE (AI): The Hypixel mode sends C03(true) through sendPacketSilent, which bypasses the packet event bus, the moment fallDistance reaches 2 blocks while there is ground below (AntiFall.isBlockUnder). Reporting onGround=true resets the server-side entity's fallDistance accumulation, so the server never applies fall damage. Ground Spoof mode instead mutates the UpdateEvent's ground flag, which flows into the vanilla C03 emission in EntityPlayerSP.onUpdateWalkingPlayer, so the same effect is achieved without injecting an extra packet. The 2.5 fallDistance threshold keeps the spoof from running during normal jumping.

